---
import HalftoneStack from '@components/art/HalftoneStack.astro'
import Swoosh from '@components/art/Swoosh.astro'
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b">
  <!-- Ribbon bleeds off the right edge, behind the type. -->
  <Swoosh
    class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-20 -top-24 w-[min(62vw,46rem)] lg:-right-10 lg:-top-32 lg:w-[46rem]"
  />

  <div class="relative px-6 py-10 lg:px-8 lg:py-14">
    <!-- Circles sit alongside the headline at every width, as in the comps. -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] items-start gap-6 lg:gap-12">
      <HalftoneStack class="w-20 shrink-0 sm:w-28 lg:w-40" />

      <div class="min-w-0">
        <!-- Explicit breaks: the comps set this as four short columnar lines. -->
        <h1 class="display max-w-[11ch] text-[clamp(2.6rem,11vw,7.5rem)]">
          <span class="text-red">Software</span><br />
          for the<br />
          modern<br />
          age.
        </h1>

        <p class="label mt-7 text-blue">
          Useful systems.<br />
          Built with care.<br />
          Caffeine optional.
        </p>

        <p class="label mt-7 text-signal">mm@coffee:~$ make something useful</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p
      class="label mt-10 ml-auto max-w-[30ch] text-right lg:absolute lg:bottom-12 lg:right-10 lg:mt-0"
    >
      Good software is like good coffee. It should be strong, smooth, and keep
      you up at night.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
